action                       default keys
quit/close                   q, Q, ctrl-c
activate/select                   enter, space
navigation                   up, down, left, right
page navigation                   pgup, pgdown
editing                   backspace, delete, home, end
quit/close function                   F10
view                   F3, v
edit                   F4, e
undo/redo                   u, U, ctrl-z, ctrl-r
activate/toggle                   insert
